Cc: =?UTF-8?q?Artur=20=C5=9Awigo=C5=84?= <a.swigon@samsung.com>, linux-tegra@vger.kernel.org, linux-pm@vger.kernel.org, linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org, dri-devel@lists.freedesktop.org, devicetree@vger.kernel.org
